+The playbook favors governing texts, standards bodies, regulators,
+official public-sector guidance, and direct technical documentation.
+Source status matters: law changes; living pages and vendor
+documentation can change; NIST frameworks are voluntary; OECD
+recommendations are non-binding; ISO summaries do not replace the
+paid normative text; a useful procurement pattern can outlast its legal
+references. Refresh fast-moving sources before publication or a client
+decision.
